abstract: "Code that builds the Arabic-Latin Name Variants dataset (https://huggingface.co/datasets/Bayanat-Labs/arabic-latin-name-variants): Arabic-script and Latin-script names of people, places and organisations from the Wikidata JSON dump of 2026-10-26, paired and labelled as transliteration, mixed or translation/exonym, aligned word by word, with Buckwalter and ALA-LC fields, Latin spelling variants per Arabic name word, full-name clusters and a rule-built Arabic-Latin name-matching benchmark. Data derived from Wikidata (CC0 1.0); code Apache-2.0."
